WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Controls and thermostats are the brain of the system. When they fail, nothing
works right.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Quiz covering charging methods, gauge reading interpretation, leak detection
techniques, recovery procedures, and evacuation standards.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:48.000
Here's why this matters on the job: Refrigerant handling skills are tested on
the journeyman exam and evaluated by every employer.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:02:24.000
Watch out for these: Know which charging method for which metering device. And —
Know gauge reading patterns and what they indicate

00:02:24.000 --> 00:03:00.000
Take a minute before you move on. What's the one thing from this lesson you need
to remember on a service call?

